  storyText: "Drone Chase\n\nNetWatch drones scream over the rooftops. You sprint through concrete skeletons, sliding under rebar.\n\nAhead: the coastal highway out of the city, or a dark hotel tower.\n\n1. Hide in the hotel.\n2. Steal a bike and ride for the Badlands."
